  "details": "VRChat Version: 2020.4.3\n\nThis crash happens randomly -- frequently within the first 10 minutes of play -- and appears exclusive to the Oculus store version of VRChat. I have submitted logs for two instances in which I have crashed, the following errors are consistent with both of them:\n\n2020.12.05 11:28:07 Error      -  Kernel 'KEyeHistogramClear' not found\n2020.12.05 11:28:07 Exception  -  ArgumentException: Kernel 'KEyeHistogramClear' not found.\n2020.12.05 11:28:07 Error      -  Error assigning 2D texture to Invalid texture property '_HighlightRT': Dimensions must match\n2020.12.05 11:28:07 Error      -  Error assigning 2D texture to Invalid texture property '_BlurredRT': Dimensions must match\n2020.12.05 11:28:07 Error      -  Error assigning 2D texture to NONE texture property '_BlurRT1': Dimensions must match\n2020.12.05 11:28:07 Error      -  Error assigning 2D texture to NONE texture property '_BlurRT2': Dimensions must match",
